      "block_id": "p58_p04",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Note: Herb pepper may be used in any recipe calling for ground black pepper as in the frequent directive: salt and pepper to taste. Note: Either of the above-mentioned seasonings will give a peppery taste with interesting new overtones to everything from meat, fish, soups, and gravies to farmer's cheese and scrambled eggs. Variation: Fill your pepper shaker with 1 part of either of the above-mentioned herb peppers mixed with an equal part of ground black pepper.",
      "bbox": null,
